# Corsair SCIMITAR RGB ELITE, wired (USB 0x1b1c:0x1be3), Bragi property traffic only.
# iCUE (the build downloaded on 2026-10-15) on Windows 11 in a VM with the mouse passed through;
# captured with usbmon on the Linux host. Vendor interface 1 only (EP 0x04 OUT, EP 0x84 IN).
# Format: <seconds since capture start> <dir> <hex>, where > is host to device and < is device
# to host, full 128-byte frames with trailing zeros dropped. Only GET (08 02) and SET (08 01)
# frames for properties 01 02 03 07 11 12 13 14 21 22 4f 50 51 (GETs) and 01 02 03 07 21 22 (SETs)
# are kept; the lighting stream, profile transfer and key-assignment traffic are left out.
# Every request is followed by its reply.
